### reasoning_check heavy - chat/completions protocol
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/completions
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "model": "{{model}}",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "请设计一个分布式任务调度系统，要求支持：幂等、重试、优先级队列、延迟任务、失败告警。请给出：1. 架构设计 2. 核心表结构 3. 调度流程 4. 伪代码。"
    }
  ],
  "stream": true
}

